<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian Nov jobless rate flat at 6.4 pct vs Oct.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian Nov jobless rate flat at 6.4 pct vs Oct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's unemployment rate was unchanged in November at 6.4 percent while the number of unemployed fell slightly to 111,614 from 112,491, the country's Labour Exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>LITHUANIAN UNEMPLOYMENT   Nov 1996	Oct 1996	Nov 1995</p>
<p>     Unemployment rate	6.4	     6.4	     7.2</p>
<p>    Number of unemployed  111,614	 112,491	 124,425</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
